{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114154114472-1114_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261114154822\"/><p>微軟365早前因技術問題故障。</p><p>美國微軟公司的「微軟365」全球大當機一天後，周六（14日）全面恢復服務。</p><p>微軟表示，今次故障是「網絡容量升級」期間發生，並非由網絡攻擊或人工智能（AI）代理引起，公司對發生技術問題致歉，目前已解決根本問題，使用 Outlook、Teams和Copilot的客戶應該不再受到影響。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:01:55.911155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:41:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T14:40:14.628138+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:55:24.468552+00:00","content_hash":"7ceb9a017e436d2e67dd777855f28b4b1748dcf441a58b19930ef278aa64ee2f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}